Without a default commodity, a USD counterposting remains a raw exchange despite SEK lot cost.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {{100 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -100 USD

